            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Expelled - the adventure of a rabbit on dangerous planets, and all in order to use the only chance to get out of prison and return home to his wife and children. Will the rabbit solve all the problems and do not die with a single chance? Only by playing the game you will learn this.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow did he get in prison? <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe story will unfold by playing this game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn game the Space Prison will sent rabbit on the various planets to destroy dangerous monsters.<br />\r\nPlanet after planet and so on. But what's hides behind wiping out population of all planets?<br />\r\nWarden Hog gave rabbit a promise to free him after all missions, but will he keep his promise? Or he will just use him in his goal?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOnly by playing the game you will learn this.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExpelled is a platform game which features:<br />\r\n- Unusual weapons of the protagonist.<br />\r\n- A way of winning the level is unusual.<br />\r\n- Traps, spikes, etc.<br />\r\n- Storytale.",
            "about_the_game": "Expelled - the adventure of a rabbit on dangerous planets, and all in order to use the only chance to get out of prison and return home to his wife and children. Will the rabbit solve all the problems and do not die with a single chance? Only by playing the game you will learn this.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow did he get in prison? <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe story will unfold by playing this game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn game the Space Prison will sent rabbit on the various planets to destroy dangerous monsters.<br />\r\nPlanet after planet and so on. But what's hides behind wiping out population of all planets?<br />\r\nWarden Hog gave rabbit a promise to free him after all missions, but will he keep his promise? Or he will just use him in his goal?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOnly by playing the game you will learn this.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExpelled is a platform game which features:<br />\r\n- Unusual weapons of the protagonist.<br />\r\n- A way of winning the level is unusual.<br />\r\n- Traps, spikes, etc.<br />\r\n- Storytale.",
